{"seq":20,"slug":"xr-game-development","title":"VR 与 AR 游戏开发","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# VR 与 AR 游戏开发\n\n戴上头显的那一刻，玩家不再隔着屏幕操纵角色，而是用自己的身体站进了游戏里。这种从「看见世界」到「身处世界」的转变，正是扩展现实（XR）游戏开发与传统游戏开发分道扬镳的根本原因。屏幕游戏可以靠精美画面取胜，而 XR 游戏一旦帧率掉到 72Hz 以下、一旦手抬起来虚拟手却慢半拍、一旦传送时天旋地转，玩家立刻摘下头显——身体的诚实让 XR 对工程质量近乎苛刻。\n\n本 hub 围绕这条「身体在场」的主线展开，四章层层递进，从硬件底座一路走到多人共享空间。\n\n第一章「[基础](1_foundations/_INTRODUCTION.md)」回答「机器如何骗过你的眼睛和身体」。它讲清 VR/AR/MR 的边界与 2026 年主流设备（Quest 3、Apple Vision Pro 等）的显示与算力参数，讲清头显与控制器如何在毫秒级内把你的真实动作搬进虚拟世界，又讲清为什么 XR 渲染要在一帧 13.8 毫秒里画两遍画面、靠注视点渲染和重投影才勉强够用。没有这层底座，上层的一切体验都无从谈起。\n\n第二章「[沉浸与舒适](2_immersion-comfort/_INTRODUCTION.md)」把底座的算力转化为「我真的在那里」的主观感受，同时守住「我不会吐」的生理底线。临场感不是画质堆出来的，而是动作—感知闭环、空间音频、触觉与深度线索共同织成的错觉；而移动方式与晕动症则是一枚硬币的两面——任何把虚拟世界推过你眼睛却不推过你内耳的设计，都在制造前庭冲突。\n\n第三章「[交互设计](3_interaction-design/_INTRODUCTION.md)」研究当玩家伸出手，世界该如何回应。它涵盖抓取与物理、射线与远距操作的空间交互范式，手部追踪与控制器各自的取舍，以及在没有屏幕边框的三维空间里如何安放 UI 与叙事。这一章是把前两章的「在场」与「舒适」落实成可玩机制的地方。\n\n第四章「[AR 与进阶](4_ar-advanced/_INTRODUCTION.md)」把虚拟内容请回真实房间。它讲 AR 如何理解你的客厅、把数字物体钉在真实桌面上，讲透视与混合现实如何让虚实共存、彼此遮挡，最后讲多人如何在同一个物理空间里看见对齐的同一份内容——这是 XR 从单人体验走向社交平台的关口。\n\n四章之间不是并列的知识点，而是一条依赖链：基础决定沉浸的上限，沉浸决定交互的可信度，交互的成熟才让 AR 与多人这样的进阶形态有意义。读完本 hub，你应当能从一块屏幕参数，推演到一个不会让人晕、让人愿意伸手、让两个人在同一张真实桌子上对弈的 XR 游戏。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xr-fundamentals","title":"XR 基础与设备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations/xr-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tracking-input","title":"追踪与输入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations/tracking-input"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering-performance","title":"XR 渲染与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/foundations/rendering-performance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"immersion-comfort","title":"沉浸与舒适","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/immersion-comfort","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"presence-immersion","title":"临场感与沉浸","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/immersion-comfort/presence-immersion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"locomotion","title":"移动与传送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/immersion-comfort/locomotion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"comfort-motion-sickness","title":"舒适度与晕动症","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/immersion-comfort/comfort-motion-sickness"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"interaction-design","title":"交互设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/interaction-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spatial-interaction","title":"空间交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/interaction-design/spatial-interaction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hand-tracking","title":"手部追踪与控制器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/interaction-design/hand-tracking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spatial-ui-xr","title":"空间 UI 与叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/interaction-design/spatial-ui-xr"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ar-advanced","title":"AR 与进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/ar-advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ar-tracking-anchoring","title":"AR 追踪与锚定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/ar-advanced/ar-tracking-anchoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"passthrough-mr","title":"透视与混合现实","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/ar-advanced/passthrough-mr"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multiplayer-shared-xr","title":"多人与共享空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/xr-game-development/ar-advanced/multiplayer-shared-xr"}]}]}